Subject: [PATCH] Use bounded userspace pipes between leaf builtins

Keep proven descriptor-free builtin pipeline edges in process memory. Preserve kernel pipes for uncertain, dispatcher, shadowed, dynamic, redirected, and external stages; test bounded backpressure and broken-pipe closure semantics.

